image and press Save.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:44.040
And now, we have our first
deployment profile created.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.580
We can also see that the
corresponding scaffold.yaml

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.980
