the application directory.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:52.040
So the default profile
here is configured

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:56.590
to use Docker engine APIs
to build this application.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.150
And this behavior can be
fine-tuned with the properties

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:00.608
available here.

00:18:00.608 --> 00:18:02.150
And the default
profile is configured

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:04.682
to use kubectl to
deploy this application.

00:18:04.682 --> 00:18:06.890
We can add more profiles as
we need using the Add New

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.590
option here, or we can
use the Edit button here

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.550
to edit the profile.

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.310
So I'll go ahead and edit it.

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:18.390
Instead of hardcoding
