00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:26.177
So we have the
call stack window,

00:23:26.177 --> 00:23:27.760
and we have the
variables window here,

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.125
where we can watch the
block local, local,

00:23:30.125 --> 00:23:32.380
and global variables.

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:34.520
And we also have the
watch window here.

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:37.980
We can inspect the
variable names.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:41.940
Looks like the vote we have
just posted is coming out fine.

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:44.190
Let's see what's going on
