00:29:19.790 --> 00:29:21.740
And so some things
you can do here

00:29:21.740 --> 00:29:24.950
are see a lot of your Kubernetes
resources right from the IDE.

00:29:24.950 --> 00:29:27.202
And you can perform simple
actions against those

00:29:27.202 --> 00:29:28.910
and use them to find
out more information

00:29:28.910 --> 00:29:30.120
about what's going on.

00:29:30.120 --> 00:29:31.850
So if we want to check out
how our deployments are doing,

00:29:31.850 --> 00:29:33.170
you can open Deployments tab.

00:29:33.170 --> 00:29:34.700
And we'll see both
our deployments

00:29:34.700 --> 00:29:37.280
are running as expected as
indicated by the screen icon

00:29:37.280 --> 00:29:37.980
here.

00:29:37.980 --> 00:29:40.388
If something wasn't going
right, that would be yellow.

00:29:40.388 --> 00:29:41.930
We can look inside
of our deployments

00:29:41.930 --> 00:29:42.763
to see the replicas.

00:29:42.763 --> 00:29:45.040
And if we want to scale,
those will update.

00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:46.610
And if we want any
more information,

00:29:46.610 --> 00:29:49.520
we can right click to
describe our deployment.

00:29:49.520 --> 00:29:52.635
And so we'll get all that
information here as well.

00:29:52.635 --> 00:29:55.010
We can do some really cool
things, like stream logs right

00:29:55.010 --> 00:29:56.150
from our pods.

00:29:56.150 --> 00:29:57.730
So if we go into
our pods and click

00:29:57.730 --> 00:30:01.400
on our voting application, you
can stream logs right here.

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:03.140
And we'll see that
vote that Sujit just

00:30:03.140 --> 00:30:05.465
made coming down here
at the bottom, which

00:30:05.465 --> 00:30:07.010
is getting blocked.

00:30:07.010 --> 00:30:10.260
And if I want to go
back to our application

00:30:10.260 --> 00:30:14.483
and post another
vote, we're going

00:30:14.483 --> 00:30:16.400
to see that vote coming
in here, too, as well.

00:30:19.870 --> 00:30:21.830
And then we can go
inside of our containers

00:30:21.830 --> 00:30:25.690
and get access to our terminal.

00:30:25.690 --> 00:30:28.173
So if I click on the container
for our voting application,

00:30:28.173 --> 00:30:29.090
