00:30:49.190 --> 00:30:50.870
and other environment
variables right

00:30:50.870 --> 00:30:52.530
from the cluster explorer.

00:30:52.530 --> 00:30:54.410
And this is a really
great way to increase

00:30:54.410 --> 00:30:56.520
the visibility of what's
going on in your cluster.

00:30:56.520 --> 00:30:59.450
And as I mentioned, while
we're showing you this in GKE,

00:30:59.450 --> 00:31:01.250
we do have the cluster
explorer available

00:31:01.250 --> 00:31:03.423
for any Kubernetes cluster.

00:31:03.423 --> 00:31:06.090
So let's take a bit of a summary
